Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- ⌘⇧2 / «Вся страница»: the page script does a lazy-load pass, keeps fixed
  headers once and hides bottom bars, then the browser captures tiles
  beyond the viewport (Page.captureScreenshot, ≤ 8000 px each, screen
  scale) through a DevTools session of its own (CdpSession, no infobar);
  the page stitches them and opens a markup editor (arrow, box, note pin,
  blur, crop; export at full size; copy, as a bug, PNG, drag out).
- «Телефон» (P): the page again in a new tab of the same Space, split with
  this one, emulated as iPhone 16 Pro / Pixel 9 / iPad mini (metrics, touch,
  UA, fit to the pane), dark scheme, reduced motion, slow 3G, landscape; the
  frame is drawn by the page script; Boost changes apply to both tabs.
- QR of the page's address (components/qr_code_generator) for http(s)
  pages only. localhost and files are refused here: they'd need a server on
  the network, left for later.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SwxrQ2eLfJ2bv8cCoG2va1
